    "A backup holds your favorites, history and rules. Importing adds what is missing and leaves the rest alone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Backup enthält Favoriten, Verlauf und Regeln. Beim Import wird ergänzt, was fehlt; alles andere bleibt unangetastet."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A backup holds your favorites, history and rules. Importing adds what is missing and leaves the rest alone."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Копия хранит избранное, историю и правила. Импорт добавляет недостающее и не трогает остальное."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A list runs the posts together, divided by a line. Cards give each post a panel of its own. Showing hidden threads brings them back as dimmed one-line rows you can tap to restore." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Liste führt die Beiträge zusammen, getrennt durch eine Linie. Karten geben jedem Beitrag eine eigene Fläche. Verborgene Threads kommen als gedimmte einzeilige Zeilen zurück, die sich zum Wiederherstellen antippen lassen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A list runs the posts together, divided by a line. Cards give each post a panel of its own. Showing hidden threads brings them back as dimmed one-line rows you can tap to restore."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Список идёт сплошным потоком, посты разделены линией. Карточки дают каждому посту свою панель. Показ скрытых тредов возвращает их тусклой строкой, по которой можно нажать, чтобы восстановить."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A passcode is bought on the site. It removes the captcha and raises the file limit." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Passcode wird auf der Seite gekauft. Er entfernt das Captcha und erhöht das Dateilimit."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A passcode is bought on the site. It removes the captcha and raises the file limit."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Пасскод покупается на сайте. Он убирает капчу и повышает лимит файлов."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule hides every post matching it, on every board unless you narrow it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine Regel verbirgt jeden passenden Beitrag, auf allen Boards, solange du sie nicht einschränkst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A rule hides every post matching it, on every board unless you narrow it."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Правило скрывает все подходящие посты на всех досках, если не ограничить его."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rule with nothing selected never matches." : {
